{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>When he heard</b> Two times in the Masorah: שמע יעקב — as in יחילו כשמע צור. When will this be fulfilled? When the report of Jacob's redemption goes forth." "<b>And he embraced him and kissed him</b> First he embraced him to check whether he had coins girded at his waist, and when he found nothing, he kissed him to check whether there was a precious stone in his mouth." "<b>And he embraced him and kissed him</b> In gematria: חיבקו לגזול מה שעליו (he embraced him to rob what is on him)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:21.852036827Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}